+### Step 1A: Freeze the exact-head packet and harvest same-head feedback
+
+Before mutation, bind the protected review round to one immutable packet: PR, base SHA, full 40-character head SHA, exact diff, acceptance criteria, changed-surface validation evidence, and runtime/provider versions. Give parallel bounded reviewers this same packet; do not make each reviewer rediscover mutable PR state or rerun broad suites. Pre-commit snapshots may be hashed for advisory exploration, but never count as protected approval.
