+### 6. Durable transition controller
+
+Shepherd reports state and never merges. A separate controller:
+
+- consumes journal/events instead of chat polling;
+- keys idempotency by repository + PR + head SHA + transition;
+- acquires leases and heartbeats;
+- reclaims expired workers;
+- rechecks exact head, issue ownership, reviews, threads, checks, settle, and mergeability before every mutation;
+- drives merge → exact-merge verification → evidence → closure → next-at-bat;
+- stores actionable failure and bounded retry state.
